scn 1
# Three Drakes (Crusades) ordered together onto an Aramon Barracks (arakeep, 7x12): AirToGroundHover
# (41d820) rings the target, and with the air-traffic counter at 5 or more its stage 4 steps out of the
# stack (VTOL_StepOut, 4214b0). Through protocol 306 World kept no counter: the three settled 3-13 px apart
# on the ring for the whole fight (the owner's 0.9.12 replay: 42% of the hover ticks stacked).
name air-stack-barracks
ticks 1800
seed 7
players 2
crusades on
weapons on
map flat 160 160
type drake fbi zondrake
type keep fbi arakeep
group drakes 0 drake 3 cells 20,78 20,80 20,82
group keep 1 keep 1 cells 70,80
at 2 attack drakes @keep
pair stack drakes drakes cells=2
